  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧與國際經營管理",
    "sub_ename": "ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENECE AND INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS",
    "describe_ch": "為讓學生掌握科技智能發展並探討不同技術導入對國際經營與貿易領域的影響，本課程將介紹人工智慧、大數據、雲端運算、物聯網及平台等五大領域，並以個案分析方式探討智能技術如何解決跨國經營與貿易的企業核心問題。",
    "describe_eh": "To acquire the developments in artificial intelligence-related technologies and investigate the impacts of these technologies on international business, this course will provide students basic foundations of artificial intelligence, big data, cloud computing, AIoT, and platform fields. Students will use real cases to learn how these technologies applied to international business and trade. Thus, they can foster some capabilities regarding analysis and problem-solving in international business area.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
