    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. 課堂出席 20% 2. 課程心得&nbsp;與實做30% 3. 期中報告 20% 4. 期末報告 20% 5.ilearn討論區參與 10%&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Attendances includes class attendance and participation. If you don&#39;t come to class more than 4 weeks, you will be failed.</div>\n\n<div>Project presentation will be peer-evaluated, everyone can give a score to the presentation.</div>\n\n<div>This class do not have a paper-based exam, all the knowledge you learned should be shown in your project presentation and weekly individual report.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "每週點名，如果遲到超過半堂課以上，該堂課程視為缺席。\n上課請遵守發言規則，想發言時請舉手，並彼此尊重發言權利。",
    "course_pol_en": "If you are late for more than half of a class, you will be considered absent from that class. \nPlease follow the rules of speaking in class, raise your hand when you want to speak.\nPlease respect each other's right to speak.\nParticipate in the class actively.\nNo eating in the class.\nYou may use your smartphone to search information, but you are not allowed to use earphone in the class.",
    "course_rem": "本課程將會包含大量討論及實做，請同學們在上課時，攜帶自己的筆電或者平板，以利操作。",
    "course_rem_en": "AI grows very fast, if you have interests on it, you can fetch a lot of resources online.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>禁止抄襲，每小組的研究報告需要通過Turnitin比對重複率小於30%的要求。</div>\n\n<div>若使用AI工具，請註明如何使用，所給予的指令有哪些，產出何種結果，在報告組織上如何使用。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Plagiarism is prohibited, and each group&#39;s research report will need to pass the Turnitin Comparison Repeat Rate of less than 30% requirement.<br />\nIf AI tools are used, please specify how they are used, what instructions are given, what results are produced, and how they are used in the organization of the report.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
